	(text "LM5165Y-Q1  24V -> 3.3V  PFM MODE  (ref: TI SNVSAJ3C, Design 2)\nVin(nom)=24V  Vin(max)=45V (TVS clamp)  Vout=3.3V  Iout(max)=50mA\n\nMODE: RT tied to GND -> PFM (light-load efficiency, Iout max 100mA)\n\nR_ILIM = 56.2k (1%) -> Ipk = 120mA\n  PFM: Iout(max) = Ipk/2 = 60mA  (design target 50mA)\n\nL_F = 47uH, Isat >= 0.5A  (Coilcraft LPS4018-473MRC)\n  Eq.19: Fsw = (Vout/(L*Ipk)) * (1 - Vout/Vin)\n         Ipk = 120mA * 1.1 = 132mA (comparator delay margin)\n         Fsw @24V = (3.3/(47u*0.132)) * (1 - 3.3/24) = ~460kHz\n  Eq.20: L_min = Vin(max) * ton(min) / IL(max)\n         = 45V * 180ns / 0.25A = 32.4uH  -> 47uH OK\n\nC_OUT = 10uF, 10V, X7R, 0805\n  Eq.22: Cout >= 100 * L * (Ipk/Vout)^2\n         = 100 * 47u * (0.132/3.3)^2 = 7.5uF  -> 10uF OK\n  Eq.21: dVout = Iout*4us/Cout + Vout/123\n         @12mA = 4.8mV + 26.8mV = ~32mV pk-pk\n\nC_IN = 1uF, 100V, X7R (rating >= 2x Vin(max))\n  Add 4.7uF electrolytic bulk if source > ~5cm away\n\nPIN CONFIG:\n  VOUT  -> output node (internal FB divider, Y version)\n  EN    -> VIN (always on)\n  SS    -> open (internal 900us soft start)\n  HYS   -> open\n  PGOOD -> optional: 100k pull-up to 3.3V ONLY (abs max 16V)\n           rises at 94% Vout (~3.1V), falls at 87% (~2.87V)\n  PAD   -> GND with thermal vias"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.96 54.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "18b374d3-fb77-4ade-acb7-8f1b0858924f")
	)
